cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated SoCG 2025 paper using
  the metadata in preferred-citation.
title: "Ultra-High-Dimensional Nearest-Neighbor Search"
type: software
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-09-06
repository-code: "https://github.com/martingherold/ultrahigh_ann"
authors:
  - family-names: Herold
    given-names: "Martin G."
license: GPL-3.0-only
abstract: >-
  An experimental C++ implementation and benchmarking framework for
  nearest-representative search with sublinear coordinate acquisition in
  ultra-high-dimensional spaces. It includes exact, flat sampled,
  hierarchical sampled, and uniform-sampling methods for the l1 and l2 norms.
keywords:
  - approximate nearest neighbor
  - coordinate sampling
  - nearest-representative search
  - ultra-high-dimensional data
